SELECT 3 FROM [CLASS(ARCH 1001), CLASS(ARCH 2000), SELECT 1 FROM [CLASS(ARCH 2103), CLASS(ARCH 2600), CLASS(ARCH 2601)]] : "Prerequisites" : 3;
